e both of their lips remain completely closed. A soft golden light bloom rises over the cityscape behind them and the frame gently brightens toward the end.\n\noverall_soundscape: A warm breeze rustles the greenery beside the stairs and sways the girl's ribbon, while faint distant traffic and city murmur drift up from the streets below. Light footsteps shift on the staircase and fabric moves softly as the two lean toward each other.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse piano notes at a slow tempo are joined by warm sustained strings that gradually swell with gentle emotion, rising through the middle shots and softening into a delicate high-string shimmer as the light blooms at the end.", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 239, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 240, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 242, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 244, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 245, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 249, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 132, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "length": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 15}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "anomalous_hashes": {"118_minimax_h3\\minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensor